      "hardware_label": "Ryzen AI Max 395",
      "notes": "Bosgame M5 mini PC: AMD Ryzen AI Max 395 (Strix Halo, gfx1151), 128 GB LPDDR5X unified memory. llama.cpp via kyuz0 amd-strix-halo-toolboxes vulkan-radv Docker image. Hesamation Claude 4.6 Opus reasoning distillation of Qwen 3.6 35B-A3B (sparse MoE, 3B active per token). Single-stream 512/512 via vllm bench serve at concurrency 1, 20 prompts. Median TPOT 16.76 ms (~60 t/s decode). KV cache q8_0. Slightly faster than the unsloth UD-Q6_K_XL variant of the base model on the same rig (55.65 vs 50.36 t/s) \u2014 non-dynamic Q6_K has lower per-layer overhead.",
